<title>UK: World Bank adds 100 million rand to one-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 100 million rand to one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 million rand from 200 million rand, lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said. There are new issue and reoffer prices.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0	MATURITY    10.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101	 PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    100.1     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   0.90</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
